{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Smash Out Colony</i> is a roguelite brick-breaker where timing is everything. Swing your hammer to deflect ricocheting projectiles, crush waves of enemies, and survive escalating chaos. With randomized upgrades, unique hammer types, game altering tools, and physics-driven mayhem, every run is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/78a967eaf5a323666f65a7925e560f57.poster.avif?t=1767621624\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/78a967eaf5a323666f65a7925e560f57.webm?t=1767621624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/78a967eaf5a323666f65a7925e560f57.mp4?t=1767621624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin-off to the award-winning <strong><i>Cast Out Colony</i></strong>, this fast-paced action game delivers tight mechanics, brutal enemy waves, and just enough unpredictability to keep you on your toes. You'll also see some familiar faces along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/127efa5dc1bfd68432fe526bf13ed367.poster.avif?t=1767621624\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/127efa5dc1bfd68432fe526bf13ed367.webm?t=1767621624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/127efa5dc1bfd68432fe526bf13ed367.mp4?t=1767621624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find &amp; Collect Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout each run, you\u2019ll discover powerful tools that shape how you play. Some tools synergize with your projectiles and other tools, creating wild combos, while others grant raw stat boosts. Experiment freely and discover the build that completely breaks your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Hammers &amp; Projectiles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, you can unlock new hammers and projectiles. Projectiles can have new mechanics and playstyles, giving you more ways to approach future runs. While hammers can help your destructive force in the battles!\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SMASHING!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3701810/23662317a1136571ff8e9c240b075dc5b25af08a.jpg"},{"name":"With my Own Two Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3701810/20c2a65b143bf77a296baf0ede1ff3ebcc696b0d.jpg"},{"name":"Third Projectile is the Charm!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3701810/33ca5440cab65795aad141354ce426a241be427c.jpg"},{"name":"The Juggler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3701810/23cfe0c0d83f8bfb100080d80c10617f34c7c44c.jpg"},{"name":"Armed to the Mandible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3701810/efa04bf1a36fa5b5a7e3ee6c9e1c7ac56833ceb6.jpg"},{"name":"Well Prepared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3701810/d00b95b3ac28e97349303b9c92a0a09180a8f826.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Loaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3701810/e50425daa12c54e68da1cfc212dbc517e1572ed2.jpg"},{"name":"Absolutely Hammered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea